=== Bazel Compatibility Validation ===
Date: 2026-08-12
APM version: 0.28.0
Bazel: Not installed on evaluation workstation (Windows dev machine)
       Bazel builds are executed in CI (Linux) or via bazelisk.

--- Test Approach ---
APM does NOT integrate with or modify the Bazel build graph. It operates
exclusively at the file-system level, writing files into:
  - .github/instructions/
  - .github/prompts/
  - .github/agents/
  - .apm/
  - apm_modules/
  - AGENTS.md (if generated)

None of these paths are referenced by S-CORE Bazel BUILD files.

