None of the above paths appear in any Bazel BUILD or MODULE.bazel file.
Verified via grep: no Bazel target references apm.yml, apm.lock.yaml,
or .github/instructions/.

--- Non-interference Confirmation ---
APM files:
  - Are not added to any Bazel glob() or filegroup()
  - Do not conflict with any existing Bazel source path
  - Do not modify WORKSPACE, MODULE.bazel, or any BUILD file
  - Are ignored by .bazelignore (if configured) or simply not discovered

